      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. Domestic Partnership Registration. Persons\nmay register as domestic partners if they are residents of the\nCity of New York or at least one partner is employed by the City\non the date of registration. In order to register, persons shall\nexecute a domestic partnership registration certificate and\nsubmit it to the City Clerk, who shall maintain a registry of\ndomestic partnerships. No person shall be eligible to register\nas a domestic partner who at the time of registration or at any\ntime during the prior six months was registered as a member of\nanother domestic partnership.",
